Dusk Ocean by Adil Kairolla (MacPaper Engine)
https://github.com/adilkairolla/macpaper-engine/tree/main/Samples/Dusk%20Ocean.macpaper

The shaders in that folder (shaders/ocean.metal and shaders/film-grain.metal) and the
engine helpers they call (Sources/MacPaper/Render/ShaderSource.swift) were written for the
MacPaper Engine repository, https://github.com/adilkairolla/macpaper-engine . They carry no
licence header of their own, so they fall under the repository's licence, which is stated in
two places (repository state at commit 5e316a7edcf79e6472920718c732b8d8bcfa541f):

  1. LICENSE at the repository root, lines 1 to 8 (the whole file is reproduced at the end
     of this file):
     https://github.com/adilkairolla/macpaper-engine/blob/5e316a7edcf79e6472920718c732b8d8bcfa541f/LICENSE

       "MIT License

